subgraph FA["src/faithfulness/ · ★ GRACE"]
    direction TB
    G1["<b>index.py</b> · <b>ONE FI PER WINDOW</b> (one ego, so one FI)<br/>the ego has few neighbours, so BRUTE FORCE every single edge.<br/>ceiling = the largest shift · floor = the mean shift over all edges<br/><b>FI_i = ( shift(MoRF) − floor ) / ( ceiling − floor )</b><br/>1 = attention found the truly strongest edge · 0 = no better than chance<br/>below 0 = worse than chance. when ceiling equals floor, drop the window.<br/><b>faithfulness_from_curves</b> reads the single rows of the ablation,<br/>so the table costs NO new forward pass. H3 regresses on THIS"]
    G2["<b>validation.py</b> · <b>THE GATE</b><br/>AUROC against the known synthetic graph.<br/>if the method cannot find a graph we planted,<br/>no number from the real data is trustworthy"]
    G3["<b>sanity.py</b> · two parts<br/>1 · fixed draws, mask nothing → the shift must be 0<br/>2 · free draws, mask nothing → the NOISE FLOOR.<br/>every arm must beat that floor"]
end

